# lychee ignore patterns (one regex per line).
#
# Self-referential raw asset URLs pinned to this repo's main branch. The
# profile README must use absolute raw URLs (org-profile relative paths have
# a documented render gotcha), but those URLs 404 to lychee until the PR that
# adds them merges to main — a chicken-and-egg the link check can't resolve.
# They render correctly the moment the squash lands; skip them here.
^https://raw\.githubusercontent\.com/telaron-labs/\.github/main/
